### 3. ReportController validation

Rewrite index. Use Carbon for date validation. Need import Carbon? `Illuminate\Support\Carbon`. Implement private methods.

```php
$allowedTabs = ['bku','journal','trial_balance','income_statement','balance_sheet'];
$tab = (string) $request->query('tab','bku');
if (!in_array($tab,$allowedTabs,true)) $tab='bku';
$startDate = $this->validDate($request->query('start_date')) ?? now()->startOfMonth()->format('Y-m-d');
$endDate = $this->validDate($request->query('end_date')) ?? now()->format('Y-m-d');
if ($startDate > $endDate) { swap }
```

Date validation:
```php
private function validDate(mixed $value): ?string
{
  if (!is_string($value) || !preg_match('/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/',$value)) return null;
  [$y,$m,$d] = array_map('intval', explode('-',$value));
  if (!checkdate($m,$d,$y)) return null;
  return sprintf('%04d-%02d-%02d',$y,$m,$d);
}
```
Good.

